# 2x2 flush piston door, hidden redstone behind the wall. 10 wide (x), 6 deep (z), 4 tall.
# wall is row z=1, doorway is x=4..5. walk through north<->south.
# lever ON = door closed (pistons extended), lever OFF = open.
# power: lever -> trunk at z=4 -> each side has a block behind the top piston (fed from behind)
# and a block behind the bottom piston (fed from the outside end), all pointing at the pistons.
palette:
S smooth_stone
B stone_bricks
E sticky_piston[facing=east]
W sticky_piston[facing=west]
D redstone_wire
L lever[face=floor,facing=north,powered=false]

